	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Nobilis <persName ref="p863">Tadeus Dunus</persName>, medicus noster <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et frater fidelis, qui apud vos nunc agit, per <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>literas petiit, ut supplicationis tę (clarissime domine mi), <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quam mihi ad ecclesiam <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensem</placeName> pręter<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>itis diebus miseras, exemplar sibi a me hinc <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> mitteretur.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ego enim, ut scis negocia <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tua mihi tuto commissa fuisse, eas literas <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tuas, quas tu mihi credidisti, tibi per nuncium <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hunc <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensem</placeName> fidelem fratrem remitto.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Tę erit nunc libertatis medico literarum copiam <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>facere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cupio tamen humanitati tę consilium <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>meum apperire, si aliquid adhuc contra evangelii <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hostes nostri <placeName ref="l294">Locarnenses</placeName> conarentur tentare: <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nollem hoc in tempore immanes hos papistas, qui nec <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>minis neque benignitate cicurari possunt, irritare, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sed potius quamlibet iniuriam, vim ac contumeliam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>perpeti ac suffer e, donec misericors pater coelestis, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>qui curam nostri peculiarem gerit per illum delictum, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nos a potestate ac illorum crudelitate liberet et <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>defendat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Prudentia tua, quę hęc omnia longe <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>melius quam ipsemet ego cognoscit ac pręvidet, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>fratribus nostris <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensibus</placeName> optimum poterit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>prebere consilium.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Illorum erit tuis parere mandatis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> nihil certum, quod ad te scribam, teneo pręter <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>obsidionem oppidi, cui nomen est <placeName>Santya</placeName>, in quo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sunt circiter quatuor milia <placeName ref="l832">Gallorum</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Illud oppugnare <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>conatur <persName>Hyspanorum dux</persName> cum triginta milibus militum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Mensis nunc agit cum dimidio, quod oppidum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ab hostibus circumdatum est, et adhuc incertus <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>est exitus belli.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Si quid novi acciderit dignum <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>memorię, a me fideliter scies.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Interim vale et <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><persName ref="p8168">Antonii Marii</persName> tui, qui te diligenter amat, ne <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>obliviscaris, rogo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l93">Clavenę</placeName> non kalendis septembris <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Humanitatis tę deditissimum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>mancipium <persName ref="p8168">Antonius Marius <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Besutius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Pietate, doctrina, moribus <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>ac virtute clarissimo viro <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bulingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>antistiti <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, domino meo <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>colendissimo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z6"/>Gen <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
